<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 17.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 17.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 17     June 13   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.250     274.120     247.020   11.02 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.090     309.160     306.830    0.74 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.000     158.440     158.970   -0.61 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.844	46.960	47.182   -0.72 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  448.980     446.880     419.180    7.11 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.500     140.870     141.685   -0.84 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.152	16.122	16.185   -0.20 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  241.280     239.490     212.430   13.58 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.872	 1.875	 1.888   -0.85 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.567	 1.567	 1.581   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.400     189.830     183.135    3.42 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
